3. **Optimized Marketing Customer Acquisition (CAC):**  
   Proving an average Customer Lifetime Value (LTV) of $7,172 across multi-year cohort horizons allows our growth teams to comfortably spend up to $500 per acquired customer while securing a 14-to-1 lifetime ROI.
4. **Supply Chain Early-Warning System:**  
   Identifying peak transaction surges in late summer (August) and Q4 (October-November) provides supply chain leadership a 45-day replenishment window to avoid costly stockouts.

